  <img style="width:100%" src="https://www.tensorflow.org/images/SegmentMean.png" alt>
  </div>

  For example:

  >>> c = tf.constant([[1.0,2,3,4], [4, 3, 2, 1], [5,6,7,8]])
  >>> tf.math.segment_mean(c, tf.constant([0, 0, 1])).numpy()
  array([[2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5],
